; SET A v3: MAX PROFIT — ENGULF only + BE/Trail fix (v4.5 REQUIRED)
; Based on SetA_v2 (g.xlsx): PF=1.71, R:R=3.43x, 18 trades/6mo
; v3-draft (i.xlsx) showed relaxing pattern filters killed PF→0.99
;
; IMPORTANT: This preset REQUIRES v4.5 EA code (with BETriggerRR fix)
; Without v4.5, BE and trailing stop will NOT work!
;
; Strategy: Keep v2's strict pattern filters (proven quality),
; only relax operational limits + use BE/Trail to protect profits.
;
; Changes vs v2:
; 1. KEEP EngulfMinBodyRatio=2.0 (strict — proven quality filter)
; 2. KEEP MinBodyRangeRatio=0.4 (strict — filters bad candles)
; 3. KEEP VolumeMultiplier=1.2 (strict — filters low-vol noise)
; 4. CooldownBars 5→3 (faster re-entry, doesn't affect quality)
; 5. MaxDailyLosses 3→4 (one more chance per day)
; 6. TPMultiplier 3.0→2.5 (slightly easier to hit TP)
; 7. MinRRRatio 2.0→1.8 (marginal relaxation only)
; 8. NEW: BETriggerRR=1.0 (lock BE at 1R — main improvement)
; 9. TrailATRMult stays 1.0 (tight trail after BE locks in)
;
; Expected vs v2: similar trade count + BE converts some SL→BE exits
; → higher effective WR, better PF
